@startuml
actor User
participant CryptoCoinUI
participant Converter

User -> CryptoCoinUI: Enters amount, selects From & To, clicks 'Convert'
CryptoCoinUI -> CryptoCoinUI: Parse & validate input amount
CryptoCoinUI -> Converter: convert(amount, from, to)
Converter -> Converter: getRate(from) & getRate(to)
Converter --> CryptoCoinUI: Returns converted result
CryptoCoinUI -> Converter: convert(amount, from, "ZAR")
Converter --> CryptoCoinUI: Returns equivalent ZAR value
CryptoCoinUI -> User: Updates EndValueTF & jZarLabel
@enduml